  "instructions": [
    "heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the onions and cook until caramelized, about 8 minutes.",
    "add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "add the chicken and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the curry powder, turmeric, cayenne pepper, and salt, and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "add the coconut milk and blackcurrant jam, and bring to a simmer.",
    "reduce heat to low and let cook for 10 minutes, until the sauce has thickened.",
    "taste and adjust seasoning as needed."
